[{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0797","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0797.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54735","title":"Prebid Prebid Server 服务端请求伪造漏洞","description":"Prebid Server 是一个开源实时广告竞价平台，其部分竞价适配器（bidder adapters）在将用户提供的参数拼接至出站请求 URL 时，未对主机名和子域名进行充分校验，导致存在服务端请求伪造（SSRF）漏洞（CWE-918）。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造恶意的竞价请求参数，诱使服务器向非预期的内部或外部目标发起 HTTP 请求，从而探测内部网络服务、访问敏感端点或进一步实施横向攻击。该漏洞影响 v4.4.0 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。官方已在 v4.4.0 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54735","GHSA-4p3g-4hcj-wpvx"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:54Z","updated":"2026-07-30T20:06:04Z","remediation":"立即升级 Prebid Server 至 v4.4.0 或更高版本（https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server/releases/tag/v4.4.0）。如无法立即升级，在配置中禁用受影响的 bidder adapter，并在网络层面限制服务器出站请求目标地址白名单，阻止对内部网络的访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server/commit/494ac271cd4b5024df9123ef25ca3cff96390be3","https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server/pull/4802","https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server/releases/tag/v4.4.0","https://github.com/prebid/prebid-server/security/advisories/GHSA-4p3g-4hcj-wpvx","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/2e429c9a0087eb0ee678d77c344076eb39564d19/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54735.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/de8cd4cf30bb0d13db0dd8e177333d27a938a598/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54735.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54735.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/604ddf5b05f9e8ce70a7b6f9716ba166db0bd437/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54735.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54735.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54735.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3a7c0c4aa01967d2633d808f80f3fcd65491b947/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-547xx/CVE-2026-54735.json","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/909ac5743d56f2e84adcabaedbd2b2a35d6b0c70/2026/CVE-2026-54735/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/909ac5743d56f2e84adcabaedbd2b2a35d6b0c70/2026/CVE-2026-54735/README_KO.md","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/c40d15bc736663c338800597e967d5eaca965fc9/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54735/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0797.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0797.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0783","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0783.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54082","title":"veraPDF veraPDF-validation XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"veraPDF-validation 组件的 PDF 解析模块中存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。该漏洞源于 `PDFAValidator.validate()` 和 `GFPDAcroForm.getdynamicRender()` 两个 API 在处理不可信 PDF 文件时，使用了默认配置的 `DocumentBuilderFactory` 解析富文本注释、表单字段值及 XFA 配置，未禁用 DTD 和外部实体解析。攻击者可构造包含恶意 XML 外部实体的 PDF 文件，诱导受害者使用受影响版本解析后，导致本地文件泄露和出站网络请求。该漏洞影响 veraPDF-validation 1.25.73 至 1.30.2 及 1.31.71 版本，已在 1.30.2 和 1.31.71 中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54082","GHSA-cg9x-g3gm-h5h6"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:23:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 veraPDF-validation 至修复版本 1.30.2 或 1.31.71（Maven 坐标 org.verapdf:validation-model 及 validation-model-jakarta），在 pom.xml/build.gradle 中更新依赖版本并重新构建部署。如暂无法升级，在调用 PDFAValidator.validate(...) 或 GFPDAcroForm.getdynamicRender() 前对输入 PDF 进行来源校验，仅处理可信来源文件；同时可在 JVM 启动参数中添加 -Dorg.apache.xerces...（如 -Djavax.xml.accessExternalDTD=all 改为限制）并部署防火墙/出站网络控制，阻止服务端发起的出站请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/commit/94caa46c1a594512247fbd46c808edae39469542","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/commit/cacd9436d0de40b0e58cc7d2dbb06451619e61ec","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/pull/730","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/security/advisories/GHSA-cg9x-g3gm-h5h6","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54082.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54082.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54082.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54082.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54082.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-540xx/CVE-2026-54082.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/validation-model/CVE-2026-54082.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54082.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/validation-model-jakarta/CVE-2026-54082.yml","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/ef57640f19da1737a8612e28839821eee8a753b5/api/2026/CVE-2026-54082.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0783.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0782","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0782.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54081","title":"veraPDF veraPDF-parser PostScript Type 1 字体程序解析拒绝服务漏洞","description":"veraPDF PDF 解析器在处理 Type 1 字体的 /FontFile 字体程序时存在拒绝服务漏洞。该漏洞源于 veraPDF-parser 的 PostScript 解释器对 array N 分配操作、for 循环的零增量以及用户字典递归查找均未做限制，远程攻击者只需向目标系统提交一个包含恶意 Type 1 字体程序的 PDF 文件，即可触发无限内存分配、无限循环或栈溢出，导致验证器内存耗尽、CPU 耗尽或进程崩溃。该漏洞影响 veraPDF-parser 1.30.2 之前及 1.31.23 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 6.9，危害等级中危。官方已在 1.30.2 和 1.31.23 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54081","GHSA-7c26-995w-6f47"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:23:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 veraPDF-parser 至 1.30.2 或 1.31.23 及以上版本，这两个版本已修复 Type1 字体程序中 PostScript 数组分配、零增量循环和递归查找导致的拒绝服务漏洞。如无法立即升级，可在 PDF 解析入口处增加超时机制和内存上限限制，并过滤包含 Type1 字体的 PDF 文件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/commit/73d6ec002b98ce1f3f68640442f8e5d5613c80ce","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/commit/cb3538607a549d63504299be1088c85ae48605f4","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/pull/703","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/security/advisories/GHSA-7c26-995w-6f47","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-540xx/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/parser/CVE-2026-54081.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54081.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2026/CVE-2026-54081.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-54081.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0782.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0781","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0781.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54080","title":"veraPDF veraPDF-parser PostScript CMap 流拒绝服务漏洞","description":"veraPDF PDF 解析器的 CMap 解析器复用 PostScript 解释器，在处理 PDF 中 Type 0 字体的 /Encoding 或 /ToUnicode CMap 流时，未对 PostScript 的 array 分配操作和 for 循环增量进行限制。远程攻击者可通过提交特制 PDF 文件，触发 Integer.MAX_VALUE 大小的数组分配（约 16GB 内存）或零增量无限循环，导致验证器内存耗尽或 CPU 100% 占用，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 veraPDF-parser 1.30.2 及 1.31.23 之前的所有版本，攻击无需身份认证，仅需目标解析恶意 PDF 即可触发。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54080","GHSA-jrmc-qg6p-94fp"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:23:14Z","remediation":"升级 veraPDF-parser 至 1.30.2 或 1.31.23 及以上版本，该版本已限制 CMap 解析器中 array 分配上限并禁止 for 循环零增量。如无法立即升级，可在 PDF 处理入口处拦截包含 PostScript 运算符的 CMap 流，或限制验证任务的 CPU 时间和内存配额作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/commit/73d6ec002b98ce1f3f68640442f8e5d5613c80ce","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/commit/cb3538607a549d63504299be1088c85ae48605f4","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/pull/703","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-parser/security/advisories/GHSA-jrmc-qg6p-94fp","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-540xx/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/parser/CVE-2026-54080.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54080.md","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2026/CVE-2026-54080.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/2ea9851780633b2caab16fe048a14b38ca9a0b56/content/CVE-2026-54080.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0781.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0780","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0780.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54079","title":"veraPDF veraPDF-validation XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"veraPDF 验证库的 GFPDAcroForm.getdynamicRender() 方法在解析 PDF 中 /AcroForm 字典的 /XFA 流时，使用默认配置的 DocumentBuilderFactory（未禁用 DOCTYPE 声明、外部实体和外部参数实体），导致 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。远程攻击者只需向目标服务器提交一个包含恶意 XFA 流的特制 PDF 文件，在触发 PDF/UA-1 验证流程后即可利用该漏洞读取服务器本地任意文件或发起服务端请求伪造（SSRF）攻击。该漏洞影响 veraPDF-validation 1.17.35 至 1.30.2 及 1.31.71 版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高，攻击无需身份认证及用户交互。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54079","GHSA-36mm-w85j-3q2j"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:23:14Z","remediation":"立即升级 veraPDF-validation 至 1.30.2 或 1.31.71 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 GFPDAcroForm.java 的 getdynamicRender() 方法中，将 DocumentBuilderFactory 配置为禁用 DOCTYPE（调用 setFeature(\"http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl\", true)），并关闭外部实体加载（FEATURE_SECURE_PROCESSING、external-general-entities、external-parameter-entities）。同时避免对不可信 PDF 启用 PDF/UA-1 验证。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/commit/94caa46c1a594512247fbd46c808edae39469542","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/commit/cacd9436d0de40b0e58cc7d2dbb06451619e61ec","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/pull/730","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/security/advisories/GHSA-36mm-w85j-3q2j","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54079.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54079.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54079.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54079.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54079.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-540xx/CVE-2026-54079.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/validation-model/CVE-2026-54079.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54079.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/validation-model-jakarta/CVE-2026-54079.yml","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/27523a604e3f97178dcb3b94e85e828af75534c5/2026/CVE-2026-54079.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0780.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0780.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0779","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0779.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54078","title":"veraPDF veraPDF-validation XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"veraPDF 验证模型存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞（CWE-611），漏洞位于 validation-model 模块的 DictionaryKeysHelper.java 文件中 getRichTextStringOrStreamEntryStringRepresentation() 方法内。由于 DocumentBuilderFactory 使用默认配置，未禁用 DOCTYPE 声明和外部实体解析，远程攻击者只需向目标系统提交一个包含恶意富文本（/RC 或 /RV）条目的特制 PDF 文件，即可在解析时触发外部实体扩展，将服务器本地文件内容反射到验证报告中，导致任意文件读取和服务器端请求伪造（SSRF）。该漏洞影响 veraPDF-validation 1.25.73 至 1.30.2 及 1.31.71 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 8.7，危害等级高。官方已在 1.30.2 和 1.31.71 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.7,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54078","GHSA-3jh7-wm29-q568"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:53Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:23:14Z","remediation":"立即将 veraPDF-validation 升级至 1.30.2 或 1.31.71 及以上版本。如无法升级，可参考 OWASP XXE Prevention Cheat Sheet，在 DictionaryKeysHelper.java 的 DocumentBuilderFactory 中显式设置 FEATURE_SECURE_PROCESSING=true、disallow-doctype-decl=true 并禁用外部实体解析（http://apache.org/xml/features/disallow-doctype-decl 和 http://apache.org/xml/features/nonvalidating/load-external-dtd），同时设置自定义 EntityResolver 返回空内容。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/commit/94caa46c1a594512247fbd46c808edae39469542","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/commit/cacd9436d0de40b0e58cc7d2dbb06451619e61ec","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/pull/730","https://github.com/veraPDF/veraPDF-validation/security/advisories/GHSA-3jh7-wm29-q568","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/57d47b7d3f36bb14623bb27ddb073baead1c6714/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54078.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54078.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54078.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/37abbcb2a8225ed14d2b9dfffb1ad41b15cc2cc8/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54078.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2026-54078.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/0d2adc4a9428696b559622523817d9cdfdad97f0/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-540xx/CVE-2026-54078.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/874e41a1c528e723f9fa8f58ba0c6da7734010ef/reports/2026-07-29/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54078.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/validation-model/CVE-2026-54078.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/d736f3597b7d4aff3836025a02aa5e53fcadb427/content/posts/cve-2026-54078.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/maven/org.verapdf/validation-model-jakarta/CVE-2026-54078.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0779.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0779.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0753","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0753.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-50558","title":"Penelope Shell Handler 路径穿越导致任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Penelope 在处理 Unix 远程会话下载时，由于未对接收到的 tar 归档成员路径进行有效校验，导致存在路径遍历漏洞。攻击者可通过构造包含 \"../\" 等路径遍历字符的恶意 tar 归档文件，在操作员执行 download 命令下载时，将文件写入到预期下载目录之外的任意位置。该漏洞影响 0.19.3 之前的版本，攻击者可利用此漏洞覆盖操作员机器上的关键配置文件（如 ~/.penelope/peneloperc），进而实现远程代码执行。该漏洞主要影响使用 Unix 下载路径的操作员，CVSS 评分 5.9。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-50558","GHSA-f42x-p2mx-hm8r"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-29T16:17:52Z","updated":"2026-07-29T18:16:53Z","remediation":"建议立即将 Penelope 升级至 v0.20.0 或更高版本。该版本通过在解压前对存档成员路径进行显式验证并拒绝不安全路径，从根源上解决了路径穿越漏洞。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/brightio/penelope/commit/a040afb5db32c7e80b5e8a2f9b2164cf911cfa62","https://github.com/brightio/penelope/releases/tag/v0.20.0","https://github.com/brightio/penelope/security/advisories/GHSA-f42x-p2mx-hm8r","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a4cc8a55779a13aab23d5f0d0cd6e52496b071eb/cves/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50558.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/1fe56a0dafbbcb548bdcdd4fc990cca72ac81c28/2026/50xxx/CVE-2026-50558.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/22bf0a843f1870af65d30413f104d6fa91f5e1f4/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-50558.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/22bf0a843f1870af65d30413f104d6fa91f5e1f4/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-50558.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/32ea152709267741509ecbf76022327761e70b91/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-50558.md","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/9b1777f43cb72006ac01427b6823146d45a3862a/nvdcve/CVE-2026-50558.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b9f52bb052695dac5cabbd58e049eaac73697161/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-505xx/CVE-2026-50558.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/2226f395f690bd125e18792c9fd587b54eb15804/pypi/penelope-shell-handler/CVE-2026-50558.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/62927be547fccd2615d11ce91c5d4f8fa7f76308/content/posts/cve-2026-50558.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/1333b9df808f49c9a53ce4cb052c8e2c6b64aa2f/api/2026/CVE-2026-50558.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0753.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0942","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0942.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-66064","title":"goshs-labs goshs ACL 绕过与路径遍历漏洞","description":"goshs 文件服务器的 sendFile 处理函数在解析请求时，从原始 URL 路径提取文件名用于权限校验，但实际打开文件时使用了经过清理的路径。攻击者通过在请求路径末尾添加斜杠，可使权限校验使用的文件名为空字符串，从而绕过 .goshs ACL 文件保护规则和黑名单限制，未授权访问被禁止的文件甚至获取包含管理员 bcrypt 密码哈希的 ACL 配置文件。该漏洞影响 goshs 2.1.5 之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.3，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.3,"aliases":["CVE-2026-66064","GHSA-964w-f6gj-5236"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:19:45Z","remediation":"立即将 goshs 升级至 v2.1.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 sendFile 函数中原始请求路径与清理后路径不一致导致的 ACL 绕过问题。可通过 `go install github.com/goshs-labs/goshs@v2.1.5` 或从 GitHub Releases 下载对应二进制包更新。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）添加规则拦截以斜杠结尾的敏感路径请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/commit/f3ef599e409151d1380866e47de8b1afb0bb54fa","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/pull/222","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/security/advisories/GHSA-964w-f6gj-5236","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2026/66xxx/CVE-2026-66064.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2026/66xxx/CVE-2026-66064.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-66064.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d9d0e44f54f90ad1b4ec106b1cac94be29b99757/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-66064.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-66064.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-660xx/CVE-2026-66064.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/CVE-2026-66064.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/v2/CVE-2026-66064.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/patrickhener/goshs/CVE-2026-66064.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/patrickhener/goshs/v2/CVE-2026-66064.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0942.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0942.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0942.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0940","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0940.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-66063","title":"goshs 文件服务器路径遍历漏洞","description":"goshs 是一款功能丰富的单二进制文件服务器，广泛应用于红队测试和开发场景。其 2.1.5 版本之前存在路径遍历漏洞（CWE-22），位于 httpserver/updown.go 的多部分上传处理函数中。该函数在处理上传文件名时仅按路径分隔符 `/` 进行分割，但未对 `..` 目录跳转序列进行过滤和拒绝。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 `..` 的文件名进行上传操作，导致文件被写入到服务目录之外的位置，实现目录穿越攻击。该漏洞影响 goshs 所有低于 2.1.5 的版本，攻击无需任何认证，利用复杂度低，可导致受影响系统的机密性和完整性受损。已在 2.1.5 版本中修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-66063","GHSA-wg2q-39h6-66x9"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:23:14Z","remediation":"立即将 goshs 升级至 2.1.5 或更高版本，该版本已修复 multipart 上传文件名中路径遍历问题。如无法立即升级，可在应用层对上传文件名进行校验，拒绝包含 \"..\" 或经清理后为空字符串的文件名，并验证最终解析路径是否在允许的上传目录内。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/commit/f3ef599e409151d1380866e47de8b1afb0bb54fa","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/security/advisories/GHSA-wg2q-39h6-66x9","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2026/66xxx/CVE-2026-66063.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/66xxx/CVE-2026-66063.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-66063.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-66063.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-66063.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-660xx/CVE-2026-66063.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/CVE-2026-66063.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/v2/CVE-2026-66063.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/patrickhener/goshs/CVE-2026-66063.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/github.com/patrickhener/goshs/v2/CVE-2026-66063.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0940.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0940.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0933","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0933.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-64863","title":"goshs WebDAV MOVE 安全限制绕过漏洞","description":"goshs 是一款功能丰富的单二进制文件服务器，其 WebDAV 模式下的权限控制存在安全绕过漏洞。在 `--no-delete` 模式下，服务端本应禁止文件删除操作，但由于 `httpserver/server.go` 中的 `wdGuard` 函数将 WebDAV 的 `MOVE` 方法错误归类为仅写操作，未检查 `fs.NoDelete` 标志，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 `MOVE` 请求并附带 `Overwrite: T` 头，绕过删除限制，实现任意文件删除或覆盖。该漏洞影响 goshs v2.1.4 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。开发者已在 v2.1.4 版本中通过将 `MOVE` 方法纳入删除权限检查分支完成修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-64863","GHSA-hq33-8jgp-8qq3"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:19:45Z","remediation":"立即升级 goshs 至 v2.1.4 或更高版本，该版本在 wdGuard 中将 MOVE 方法纳入 --no-delete 检查分支，阻止 WebDAV 客户端通过 MOVE 绕过删除限制。如无法立即升级，可在 WebDAV 端口前部署反向代理（如 Nginx），通过拦截 MOVE 方法（`limit_except GET HEAD PROPFIND`）作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/commit/0444ac6b1a8176ddae70d940adf7a26b2e5a6c29","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/releases/tag/v2.1.4","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/security/advisories/GHSA-hq33-8jgp-8qq3","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2026/CVE-2026-64863.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7db8931ea0378982e66f435e269a4ed0e4efb7aa/cves/2026/64xxx/CVE-2026-64863.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/64xxx/CVE-2026-64863.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-64863.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f80eaead111eac7128eaf77e46b372cdbd675cc9/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-64863.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-64863.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-648xx/CVE-2026-64863.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-28/TIER_3_CVE-2026-64863.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/CVE-2026-64863.yml","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/v2/CVE-2026-64863.yml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0933.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0933.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0933.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0914","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0914.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-62325","title":"goshs SFTP 空密码认证绕过漏洞","description":"goshs 是一款功能丰富的单二进制文件服务器，其 v2.1.3 版本中 sftpserver.go 的密码处理器使用了 `Username != \"\" && Password != \"\"` 条件判断，当管理员以 `-b 'admin:' -sftp` 启动且未启用 `-fkf` 参数时，密码为空导致两个 SFTP 认证处理器均未设置，gliderlabs/ssh 库检测到所有处理器为空后自动启用无客户端认证模式。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可利用此缺陷直接通过 SFTP 协议连接目标服务器，实现未授权文件读取、写入、删除和重命名操作，严重威胁数据机密性和完整性。该漏洞是 CVE-2026-40884 的不完全修复，后者仅拦截了用户名为空的情况，而根本原因（`&&` 条件）仍存在于代码中。CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。已在 goshs v2.1.4 版本中修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2026-62325","GHSA-rjrw-mjq6-hpmm"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:10Z","updated":"2026-07-30T19:19:45Z","remediation":"升级 goshs 至 v2.1.4 或更高版本，该版本修复了 sftpserver.go 中密码处理器的 `&&` 条件判断逻辑。如无法立即升级，避免使用 `-b 'user:' -sftp` 格式（即密码为空）的启动参数，或启用 `-fkf` 密钥认证参数作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/commit/32f4a0e1790a709f722d0f3b2341f139d003180a","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/releases/tag/v2.1.4","https://github.com/goshs-labs/goshs/security/advisories/GHSA-rjrw-mjq6-hpmm","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/94290d9b87aa464f4465c4bb2b955170c77f08c2/cves/2026/62xxx/CVE-2026-62325.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/f3d37661d066a8369751ae98676c11a2d9ec4d21/2026/62xxx/CVE-2026-62325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-62325.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/5d8a0e95a20fbbbf3a45b439096d57770d841dec/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-62325.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2026-62325.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/c7d5dce5040792ac66f5f987fd2ed030b45edce8/reports/2026-07-28/TIER_3_CVE-2026-62325.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-623xx/CVE-2026-62325.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/db96a5d12e1a4bc3df59241db4f4f41371d4bdc0/go/goshs.de/goshs/v2/CVE-2026-62325.yml","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2026/CVE-2026-62325/README.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/63ad67a97b34adc6ff5f668eaf85b5dbf28137e8/2026/CVE-2026-62325/README_KO.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0914.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0726","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0726.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54659","title":"Pagy I18n locale 路径遍历信息泄露漏洞","description":"Pagy 宝石的 I18n 模块在设置 locale 参数时未对输入进行合法性校验，直接将用户提供的值作为文件路径组件拼接并读取对应的 YAML 字典文件。攻击者可通过构造包含 `../` 路径遍历序列或绝对路径的 locale 参数，使应用加载并解析任意服务器端 YAML 文件（如配置文件 database.yml），从而建立文件存在性与可读性的探测信道，并实现服务器端文件内容读取。该漏洞影响所有将不受信任的终端用户输入直接赋值给 `Pagy::I18n.locale=` 的 Ruby 应用，而使用可信来源设置 locale 的应用不受影响。CVSS 评分为 6.9（中等），已于 pagy 43.5.6 版本中通过限制 locale 必须符合 BCP 47 格式的方式修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.9,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54659","GHSA-2xmw-f8j8-wfxc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:09Z","updated":"2026-07-29T13:19:00Z","remediation":"立即升级 pagy gem 至 43.5.6 或更高版本，该版本在 `Pagy::I18n.locale=` setter 中增加了 BCP 47 正则校验，阻止 `../` 和绝对路径等非法值。若暂时无法升级，请在赋值前对用户输入进行正则过滤：`Pagy::I18n.locale = params[:locale].to_s[/\\A[a-zA-Z]{2,8}(-[a-zA-Z0-9]{1,8})*\\z/]`，或仅允许赋值给预设的受信任 locale 列表（如 `I18n.available_locales`），拒绝任何不在列表中的值。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/ddnexus/pagy/commit/efcf09690e9fa7d7abdfb987b785a55f87e287df","https://github.com/ddnexus/pagy/pull/908","https://github.com/ddnexus/pagy/releases/tag/43.5.6","https://github.com/ddnexus/pagy/security/advisories/GHSA-2xmw-f8j8-wfxc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8c5cb8015669b7fea66cc41d203b97a12e61abfc/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54659.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/72d8d6ef3c1d9166f26866551cee9f1f8d960919/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54659.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be04a74d8eb7583856274b2516ee1145cf8d4218/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54659.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54659.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/be04a74d8eb7583856274b2516ee1145cf8d4218/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54659.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/gem/pagy/CVE-2026-54659.yml","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/dcf23aed58c5cab14c2c44b30593196b46bb051f/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54659.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/9ffc2f6c5c73933ab0668bbefe19806a431955a8/content/posts/cve-2026-54659.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-debian/blob/9c3e0172b371d5efbbab50ce0cd0aa5c9ed664c4/tracker/CVE/2026/CVE-2026-54659.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/d7fec49e4355e166a4b0625e0b5eb4d2c8efa124/2026/CVE-2026-54659.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0726.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0725","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0725.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54658","title":"Hypequery ClickHouse SQL 注入漏洞","description":"@hypequery/clickhouse 的 escapeValue() 函数在参数替换过程中未正确转义反斜杠，导致攻击者可通过在参数值末尾添加反斜杠来转义单引号，从而注入任意 SQL 语句。该漏洞影响所有使用 @hypequery/clickhouse 2.0.2 之前版本并将用户可控输入作为查询参数传递的场景。攻击者无需身份认证即可利用此漏洞执行任意 SQL 命令，危害等级严重。厂商已在 2.0.2 版本中修复此问题。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54658","GHSA-6wcc-39rp-hh9p"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-29T13:18:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 @hypequery/clickhouse 至 2.0.2 版本，该版本已修复 escapeValue() 函数中未对反斜杠进行转义的问题。升级命令：npm install @hypequery/clickhouse@2.0.2 或 yarn add @hypequery/clickhouse@2.0.2。升级后需验证所有涉及用户输入参数的 SQL 查询是否仍能正常执行，确保参数转义逻辑正确生效。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/hypequery/hypequery/blob/main/packages/clickhouse/CHANGELOG.md#202","https://github.com/hypequery/hypequery/commit/4dfa9d77d70a08b970e722268b75ca7d13db0bdf","https://github.com/hypequery/hypequery/releases/tag/@hypequery/clickhouse@2.0.2","https://github.com/hypequery/hypequery/security/advisories/GHSA-6wcc-39rp-hh9p","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/63ef18b5a7ac062afb6feeca70a71f97ad261ce7/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54658.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/d2a9e9008e1c6ed4fdef8d3b5d090d4e3f6172a0/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54658.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7487bcebc8697fd3489bf1c4da6dea35d58f628c/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54658.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/7487bcebc8697fd3489bf1c4da6dea35d58f628c/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54658.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/10bff61c0726beeded88e9e2e9cfea3cd12c341c/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54658.json","https://github.com/alan-turing-institute/cyber-threat-observatory/blob/26642fc092283534201cf8a6d23402c6ed02ca48/reports/2026-07-28/TIER_2_CVE-2026-54658.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/npm/@hypequery/clickhouse/CVE-2026-54658.yml","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/68fa90e33d87769163a3160a6378e3c2fcd85037/nvd/2026/CRITICAL/CVE-2026-54658/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/f06af49935a942e13046c97177cb1e037f7184c7/content/posts/cve-2026-54658.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/72cbdcf5b0040806853b9597e1a625651c5a1bf9/api/2026/CVE-2026-54658.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2026/POC-AVE-2026-0725.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2026/EXP-AVE-2026-0725.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0725.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0720","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0720.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54650","title":"bablilayoub openhole-server 路径遍历漏洞","description":"openhole-server 项目存在 URL 路径解码漏洞，其在转发 tunnel 客户端请求时使用了 URL 解码后的路径 `r.URL.Path`，而非保留原始的未解码请求路径。这导致百分号编码的路径遍历字符（如 `%2e` 对应 `..`，`%2f` 对应 `/`）在到达目标本地服务时已经变成了实际的路径遍历序列 `../`，绕过了 Go 标准库 ServeMux 对 `../` 路径的检查。通过发送包含路径遍历编码的有效负载（例如 `/%2e%2e/secret.txt`），未经身份验证的远程攻击者可以读取本地服务外部的任意文件，包括 `/etc/passwd` 等敏感系统文件。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 2019/2022 等版本，使用了传统的路径遍历攻击技术，CVSS 评分高达 8.6，威胁等级极高。Microsoft 已经在 2024 年 8 月的安全更新中修复了此问题，建议所有用户立即升级至最新版本以获取补救措施。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.6,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54650","GHSA-fh2f-xfxc-q9cc"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-29T15:16:25Z","remediation":"立即升级 openhole-server 和 CLI 至 v0.1.2 或更高版本（修复版本使用 r.URL.EscapedPath() 替代 r.URL.Path 防止路径遍历），升级地址：https://github.com/bablilayoub/openhole/releases/tag/v0.1.2。如无法立即升级，建议在防火墙层面限制 openhole 服务器仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并在反向代理层增加路径规范化校验规则拦截包含 %2e、%2f 等编码遍历序列的请求。升级后建议验证 tunnel 服务正常运行并测试路径遍历载荷已被拦截。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/bablilayoub/openhole/commit/a28c27adde2a7ed0c347b730c8707208c0f78ed3","https://github.com/bablilayoub/openhole/releases/tag/v0.1.2","https://github.com/bablilayoub/openhole/security/advisories/GHSA-fh2f-xfxc-q9cc","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/09e3a6fe44c91a901bc5c246ef5d5222a6fe5bff/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54650.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54650.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54650.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/62ba6fb67d4752eaef931a307acc18168885921e/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54650.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f261edfe26ad788a761a538ae1acc9207c3f30e6/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54650.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/68fa90e33d87769163a3160a6378e3c2fcd85037/nvd/2026/HIGH/CVE-2026-54650/README.md","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/bablilayoub/openhole/CVE-2026-54650.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/da2872f085e0dec009c55ece506a2240174e7581/content/posts/cve-2026-54650.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/72cbdcf5b0040806853b9597e1a625651c5a1bf9/api/2026/CVE-2026-54650.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/09110e63eff2c5d8130d6d56a8e64068489b359a/2026/CVE-2026-54650.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0720.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2026-0718","file_name":"2026/AVE-2026-0718.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2026-54638","title":"gotd td 预认证拒绝服务漏洞","description":"gotd/td Telegram MTProto 客户端库的 proto.UnencryptedMessage.Decode 函数存在无界内存分配漏洞。该函数在解析未加密 MTProto 数据包时，直接读取攻击者可控的 32 位 dataLen 字段并立即通过 make([]byte, dataLen) 分配大块内存，而未先校验底层缓冲区是否包含足够字节。攻击者可发送仅 20 字节但声称载荷约 1.75 GB（如 dataLen=0x70000000）的伪造未加密数据包，强制运行时在拒绝长度前分配并零初始化数 GB 堆内存，导致 CPU/GC 压力飙升甚至触发 OOM 终止，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞位于未认证的 MTProto 握手路径，无需凭证或会话即可触发，影响 gotd/td v0.145.1 之前版本，CVSS 7.5 高危，仅影响可用性，不存在内存破坏或代码执行风险。官方已在 v0.145.1 中通过在分配前校验 dataLen 与剩余缓冲区长度修复该漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2026-54638","GHSA-whmm-qj9r-wvr2"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-28T23:17:08Z","updated":"2026-07-29T15:16:24Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 gotd/td 到 v0.145.1 或更高版本（修复提交：9d5d1f31ea5022d9798d84ccce15de2e91ba6baa），可通过 `go get github.com/gotd/td@v0.145.1` 升级依赖。如暂时无法升级，必须在网络层面禁止未受信任的客户端访问未加密的 MTProto 握手端口（默认 443/8443），或在网关层拦截异常大的 dataLen 字段（>1MB）的 MTProto 包，防止触发巨额内存分配导致 OOM。建议尽快升级至 v0.145.1 彻底修复该预认证拒绝服务漏洞。参考：https://github.com/gotd/td/releases/tag/v0.145.1 https://github.com/gotd/td/security/advisories/GHSA-whmm-qj9r-wvr2","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/gotd/td/commit/9d5d1f31ea5022d9798d84ccce15de2e91ba6baa","https://github.com/gotd/td/issues/1711","https://github.com/gotd/td/releases/tag/v0.145.1","https://github.com/gotd/td/security/advisories/GHSA-whmm-qj9r-wvr2","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4d40bbb471811a29843f023fbf1a8beb3373a987/cves/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54638.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2026/54xxx/CVE-2026-54638.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/CVE/data/2026/CVE-2026-54638.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8badb38e9fdd060ee46b7da7005f556b6f7db6bb/SSVC/data/2026/CVE-2026-54638.json","https://github.com/sec-dojo-com/cve-poc/blob/6d9e48809bb56eb829c7d184fbf6c6fd45cd04df/pocs/2026/CVE-2026-54638.md","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/f852dcbb0286f5d88b04c17e99702d974cf97496/CVE-2026/CVE-2026-546xx/CVE-2026-54638.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/ede50d3653e824fabe4210e54459047bef709b31/go/github.com/gotd/td/CVE-2026-54638.yml","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/da2872f085e0dec009c55ece506a2240174e7581/content/posts/cve-2026-54638.md","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-nvd/blob/72cbdcf5b0040806853b9597e1a625651c5a1bf9/api/2026/CVE-2026-54638.json","https://github.com/opencve/opencve-kb/blob/28fa1bc56eb946581b4954ed0068b7aeb55be6e9/2026/CVE-2026-54638.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2026/AVE-2026-0718.toml"}]